<title>USA: SBC Communications Inc Q1 net before merger.</title>
<headline>SBC Communications Inc Q1 net before merger.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.86		    $0.76</p>
<p> Net			517,000		  464,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,456,000		3,197,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 599,000		  609,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Results reflect SBC operations as a stand-alone company before its merger with Pacific Telesis Group. That transaction was completed April 1, shortly after the close of the first-quarter reporting period.</p>
<p>SBC's reported first-quarter earnings were in line with the $0.86 per share First Call consensus estimate.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, 212-859-1736</p>
